Package: volcanolabel
Title: Elegant Volcano Plots with Ordered Outside Labels
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jianhua", "Zhu", email = "XiaoLi1991-star@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Jianhua Zhu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jianhua Zhu <XiaoLi1991-star@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Builds publication-ready volcano plots from already prepared
    plotting columns, with polished themes and outside label columns that route
    labels back to their genes with compact elbow connectors.
